    "description": "1) From A and B, form the controllability matrix C. 2) Compute the last row of the inverse of the transformation matrix as t_n = [0 0 ... 1] C^{-1}. 3) Construct the entire transformation matrix as T^{-1} = [t_n A^{n-1}; t_n A^{n-2}; ...; t_n]. 4) Compute the new matrices from T^{-1} using Eqs. (7.21a), (7.21b), and (7.22).",
